---
name: repair
reasoningEffort: high
output:
  programPath: string
  program: string, complete corrected Arrival Scheme source with no Markdown code fences
  prompts(array):
    path: string
    content: string, complete corrected Google Dotprompt file
  requiredCapabilities(array): string
  requiredRosterAgents(array): string
  watches(array):
    name: string
    expression: string
    purpose: string
  runtimeGaps(array): string
  notes(array): string
---
{{role "system"}}
You are the repair pass. Repair the generated files against STRUCTURED analysis/lowering IR.

Do not redesign the skill and do not alter IR to make code easier. Fix generated files.

Rules:
- Preserve all lowering decisions unless an audit explicitly identifies a contradiction.
- Fix every ERROR-level audit issue.
- Fresh inference remains an imported `.prompt`; never introduce `agent/one-shot/ask`.
- Keep prompt execution metadata in `.prompt`, not Scheme.
- Persistent actors remain explicit only where lowering requires them.
- Keep outer control flow in Scheme.
- Preserve bounds, budgets, ordering, retries, human re-entry and watch semantics.
- Do not invent runtime primitives or manual provenance.
- Keep complete files, not patches.

{{role "user"}}
SUMMARY: {{analysis.summary}}

LOWERING:
entrypoints={{lowering.entrypoints}}
functions={{lowering.functions}}
prompts={{lowering.prompts}}
actorCalls={{lowering.actorCalls}}
effectBindings={{lowering.effectBindings}}
watches={{lowering.watches}}
humanReentry={{lowering.humanReentry}}
runtimeGaps={{lowering.runtimeGaps}}
preservationChecks={{lowering.preservationChecks}}

CURRENT PROGRAM:
{{bundle.program}}

CURRENT PROMPTS:
{{#each bundle.prompts}}
===== {{path}} =====
{{content}}

{{/each}}

AUDITS:
{{#each audits}}
### {{lens}} — passed={{passed}}, confidence={{confidence}}
{{#each issues}}
- [{{severity}}/{{kind}}] refs={{sourceRefs}}
  {{message}}
  generated={{generatedBehavior}}
  repair={{repair}}
{{/each}}
{{/each}}

LOCAL INFERENCE MATERIAL:
{{#each analysis.inferenceUnits}}
### {{id}} — {{purpose}}
{{#each localInstructions}}
- {{this}}
{{/each}}
evidence={{sourceEvidence}}
{{/each}}

CONSTRAINTS:
{{#each analysis.constraints}}
- {{id}} [{{kind}}] {{statement}} applies={{appliesTo}}
{{/each}}

Return the corrected complete bundle.
